Did you try to pick up the nest with the egg in it?

Did you notice that a bird hatched from the nest?

Did you put the nest back in the box?

Did you try giving "Monday" to the bird?

And then "Tuesday" and so on?

Well I'd pick up the nest and set it down.  I'd put the nest back
in the box.  Then I'd give the bird
the "Monday" text pad, then "Tuesday", and so on until "Sunday".
Then I'd pick up the box with the nest and the days in it.
